WEBVTT

01:36.430 --> 01:39.979
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.160 --> 01:42.009
[Episode 15]

01:42.120 --> 01:45.430
[By the Canal]

01:45.750 --> 01:46.310
Just say hi.

01:46.310 --> 01:47.580
I'm still cooking.

01:47.610 --> 01:48.310
Just go and meet them.

01:48.310 --> 01:49.550
They came here specially. Hurry up.

01:52.640 --> 01:53.710
Our two Mr. Li's.

01:54.350 --> 01:55.509
Let me introduce you.

01:56.390 --> 01:58.870
This is my husband, Zhou Yanlin.

01:59.509 --> 02:00.140
Master Zhou.

02:00.140 --> 02:00.460
Hello.

02:00.460 --> 02:01.510
I've heard so much about you.

02:01.530 --> 02:03.150
Master Zhou, it's my honor to meet you.

02:03.150 --> 02:04.030
Hello.

02:04.030 --> 02:04.830
Zhou,

02:04.830 --> 02:06.760
these two Mr. Li's came all the way from Beijing

02:06.760 --> 02:08.009
to taste your cooking.

02:08.030 --> 02:09.110
Give them a proper introduction.

02:09.110 --> 02:09.630
Alright.

02:09.630 --> 02:11.350
Here, please have a seat.

02:11.350 --> 02:12.190
Come, come.

02:12.550 --> 02:13.310
Let's get acquainted.

02:13.510 --> 02:14.110
Okay.

02:14.390 --> 02:15.430
Oh, you're also in this industry?

02:15.430 --> 02:16.150
Yes.

02:16.550 --> 02:17.300
This is...

02:17.790 --> 02:19.030
Huaiyang-style imperial cuisine,

02:19.960 --> 02:21.030
prepared using Qing Dynasty methods

02:21.280 --> 02:22.829
Do you two think the taste is alright?

02:23.150 --> 02:24.030
Master Zhou,

02:24.829 --> 02:25.829
my brother and I

02:25.829 --> 02:27.510
have been in the restaurant business for many years.

02:27.720 --> 02:29.440
I've spent half my life in it.

02:29.470 --> 02:30.550
But coming here,

02:30.840 --> 02:32.290
this is the first time in my life

02:32.950 --> 02:33.910
that I've been truly impressed.

02:34.500 --> 02:35.540
You two are too kind.

02:35.560 --> 02:36.360
Well, you see,

02:36.360 --> 02:38.120
it's the Olympics again next year.

02:38.120 --> 02:39.910
High-end dining in Beijing

02:39.910 --> 02:40.630
will take off.

02:40.630 --> 02:41.180
We've

02:41.180 --> 02:43.400
secured a location near Workers' Sports Complex.

02:43.400 --> 02:44.190
We're planning

02:44.190 --> 02:46.230
to open a high-end restaurant.

02:46.550 --> 02:47.670
We've even decided on a name.

02:47.950 --> 02:49.829
It will be called Suzhen Pavilion.

02:50.230 --> 02:51.230
So, Hangzhou cuisine.

02:51.990 --> 02:52.950
Yes, Hangzhou cuisine.

02:52.950 --> 02:55.230
We were actually thinking of selling that previously.

02:55.430 --> 02:56.070
But

02:56.070 --> 02:57.380
after tasting your dishes,

02:57.490 --> 02:59.770
we've decided to focus solely on Huaiyang cuisine.

03:01.510 --> 03:02.350
Master Zhou.

03:02.400 --> 03:02.990
Yes, yes.

03:02.990 --> 03:03.550
How about

03:03.950 --> 03:06.510
you take a look at our design plans first?

03:07.670 --> 03:08.720
You two take a look first.

03:12.590 --> 03:13.670
It's so grand!

03:14.360 --> 03:15.150
Master Zhou.

03:15.870 --> 03:16.520
We

03:16.710 --> 03:18.070
have set up the stage.

03:18.680 --> 03:20.310
We're just waiting for you to take the stage.

03:21.510 --> 03:22.390
As for Beijing,

03:22.870 --> 03:23.870
I've actually been there

03:24.390 --> 03:25.150
and stayed for a few years,

03:25.829 --> 03:27.910
but I wasn't very happy there,

03:27.910 --> 03:29.280
so I came back.

03:30.270 --> 03:32.550
That must be because we aren't clear with the terms.

03:32.829 --> 03:33.710
With us,

03:33.710 --> 03:34.590
you can rest assured.

03:34.870 --> 03:35.590
We

03:35.590 --> 03:38.310
will pay you according to the highest standards.

03:38.310 --> 03:39.750
Additionally, there will be shares.

03:39.750 --> 03:41.280
We absolutely won't let your efforts go unrewarded.

03:41.280 --> 03:42.550
Any apprentices you've trained

03:42.750 --> 03:44.270
will receive corresponding dividends.

03:45.550 --> 03:47.070
It's not about the terms.

03:48.030 --> 03:49.030
The main concern is that

03:49.030 --> 03:50.520
I can't leave this restaurant unattended.

03:51.270 --> 03:51.910
Or how about

03:52.230 --> 03:54.590
I send my apprentice over instead?

03:55.270 --> 03:55.710
How's that?

03:55.990 --> 03:58.000
Master Zhou, you must have some concerns.

03:58.000 --> 03:59.030
If you have any concerns, please tell us.

03:59.030 --> 04:00.270
We can find a solution together.

04:00.270 --> 04:00.830
I have no concerns.

04:00.830 --> 04:01.830
I really don't have any concerns.

04:02.270 --> 04:02.990
It's just because...

04:03.280 --> 04:05.270
I'm getting older and don't want to trouble myself.

04:05.270 --> 04:05.870
No.

04:06.470 --> 04:07.750
How old are you now?

04:08.030 --> 04:09.150
Aren't you in your prime?

04:09.560 --> 04:10.430
With your skills,

04:10.430 --> 04:11.870
isn't it a waste to stay here

04:11.870 --> 04:12.710
in this small place?

04:14.700 --> 04:15.630
Small place?

04:16.550 --> 04:17.589
What's wrong with this small place?

04:17.870 --> 04:19.070
I just like to stay in small places like these.

04:19.070 --> 04:19.910
Both of you,

04:19.910 --> 04:20.870
please continue to enjoy your meal.

04:20.870 --> 04:22.070
The dishes haven’t all arrived yet.

04:22.630 --> 04:24.340
Let me have a word with my husband.

04:26.070 --> 04:26.350
Okay.

04:26.350 --> 04:27.030
Zhou.

04:32.310 --> 04:33.870
Why are you so anxious?

04:34.550 --> 04:36.950
Zhou Yanlin, what are you trying to do?

04:37.230 --> 04:39.230
Do you really have to make things so tense?

04:39.550 --> 04:40.830
They have good intentions.

04:41.150 --> 04:42.230
It's such a good opportunity.

04:42.230 --> 04:43.670
Why do you want to give it up?

04:43.830 --> 04:45.430
If you aren't going to think about yourself,

04:45.430 --> 04:46.950
you should at least think about Haikuo.

04:46.950 --> 04:47.750
Haikuo is a senior now,

04:47.750 --> 04:48.750
yet you want him to transfer schools?

04:49.470 --> 04:50.870
Wouldn't changing to a new environment

04:50.870 --> 04:52.470
affect his studies?

04:52.470 --> 04:53.630
I've realized that we

04:53.630 --> 04:54.790
can't really communicate anymore, can we?

04:54.790 --> 04:55.630
What do you mean?

04:55.630 --> 04:56.950
Don't you think it's pathetic?

04:57.310 --> 04:58.460
I respect your choice.

04:58.900 --> 05:00.190
Please respect my choice as well.

05:00.190 --> 05:00.950
Do I not respect you?

05:00.950 --> 05:01.390
How am I disrespecting you?

05:01.390 --> 05:03.070
What were you trying to do with those guests just now?

05:03.070 --> 05:03.950
What do you mean?

05:03.950 --> 05:06.070
If you want to go to Beijing, I won't stop you.

05:06.070 --> 05:07.710
But I don't want to go to Beijing.

05:10.590 --> 05:11.790
Listen, Xu Peng,

05:11.790 --> 05:12.830
you either give your best

05:12.830 --> 05:14.030
or just quit otherwise!

05:14.580 --> 05:16.230
If you don't want to work, just go home.

05:31.580 --> 05:32.110
Dad.

05:33.310 --> 05:33.909
Come in.

05:33.909 --> 05:34.590
Have a seat.

05:46.110 --> 05:48.360
You two had another fight, didn't you?

05:49.360 --> 05:52.350
Someone invited him to open a restaurant in Beijing today.

05:52.350 --> 05:54.430
A high-end restaurant near Workers' Sports Complex.

05:54.430 --> 05:55.909
He flat out refused.

05:56.590 --> 05:57.670
You feel that...

05:58.510 --> 05:59.480
he should go?

05:59.790 --> 06:00.800
It's such a waste

06:00.990 --> 06:02.230
for his skills to be

06:02.470 --> 06:03.710
confined to this small town.

06:04.110 --> 06:04.910
A shame?

06:05.430 --> 06:07.110
The business is so bad now.

06:07.110 --> 06:08.150
It's hard to even break even.

06:08.150 --> 06:10.430
First-tier cities offer better opportunities for growth.

06:10.790 --> 06:12.110
Whether for himself

06:12.110 --> 06:13.470
or for our son,

06:13.470 --> 06:15.150
it would mean a better future.

06:16.670 --> 06:17.630
But...

06:18.300 --> 06:20.070
that's the future you want,

06:21.870 --> 06:23.680
not what Yanlin wants.

06:24.680 --> 06:25.790
But isn’t it nice for a family

06:25.790 --> 06:26.950
to stay together,

06:27.150 --> 06:28.170
live well,

06:28.470 --> 06:29.550
and not worry about food or money?

06:30.590 --> 06:32.870
Isn't that what we have now?

06:34.230 --> 06:35.110
Zhimei,

06:36.120 --> 06:37.909
if going to Beijing

06:38.150 --> 06:39.470
is what makes you happy,

06:39.470 --> 06:40.270
then go.

06:40.790 --> 06:41.710
I support you.

06:42.750 --> 06:43.790
But...

06:44.550 --> 06:45.470
If Yanlin were to go,

06:45.470 --> 06:47.230
he will not be happy.

06:50.230 --> 06:51.470
Don't push him anymore.

06:54.990 --> 06:55.990
Previously,

06:57.670 --> 06:59.430
My job was very unstable.

07:00.420 --> 07:01.470
We had to keep moving.

07:03.350 --> 07:06.030
Yanlin has been wandering with me since he was little.

07:07.980 --> 07:08.910
Life...

07:11.230 --> 07:12.300
was really tough.

07:13.310 --> 07:14.750
I rarely saw him smile.

07:15.790 --> 07:17.230
Until one day,

07:17.580 --> 07:19.990
I suddenly discovered that the child could smile.

07:20.470 --> 07:21.910
I was puzzled.

07:22.670 --> 07:24.230
He wouldn't tell me anything when I asked.

07:25.420 --> 07:27.150
Later, I secretly followed him.

07:27.430 --> 07:28.110
As it turned out,

07:28.790 --> 07:31.430
that boy was hanging out at a restaurant's back kitchen.

07:33.060 --> 07:34.740
He even found himself a master.

07:34.740 --> 07:36.120
He was an old chef from Huai'an,

07:36.470 --> 07:38.110
a family chef of Shen Jingsi.

07:38.870 --> 07:40.110
He really liked Yanlin.

07:40.670 --> 07:42.909
He taught him everything he knew.

07:43.310 --> 07:44.560
After that,

07:44.560 --> 07:45.750
he was smiling every day.

07:45.750 --> 07:46.790
He was always smiling.

07:48.780 --> 07:49.630
It was the kind...

07:50.480 --> 07:52.480
that came from the heart.

07:54.430 --> 07:56.310
Later, he told me

07:57.350 --> 07:58.980
that when he was cooking,

07:59.870 --> 08:01.990
he felt like

08:02.110 --> 08:03.790
an orchestra's conductor.

08:06.350 --> 08:08.670
Just hearing the sound of chopping

08:08.670 --> 08:10.950
made him feel at ease and happy.

08:12.990 --> 08:14.470
But it's cooking.

08:15.430 --> 08:17.470
Isn't it the same wherever he works?

08:17.790 --> 08:18.710
It's not the same!

08:19.750 --> 08:21.350
The luckiest thing

08:21.460 --> 08:23.790
for a chef isn’t making money,

08:24.470 --> 08:27.270
but that there are people who appreciate his cooking.

08:31.790 --> 08:32.510
As for Yanlin,

08:32.510 --> 08:34.150
you know what he had experienced

08:34.429 --> 08:35.549
in Beijing too.

08:37.640 --> 08:39.110
But perhaps...

08:39.549 --> 08:40.470
you haven't been able to

08:41.490 --> 08:43.470
fully understand his pain.

08:44.550 --> 08:45.470
I,

08:45.910 --> 08:47.190
as his father,

08:48.790 --> 08:51.350
sincerely hope he can be happy.

08:51.790 --> 08:53.350
I hope he can regain

08:53.350 --> 08:55.590
the smile he had when he first started learning to cook.

08:59.470 --> 09:00.670
As for this marriage,

09:01.470 --> 09:02.910
don’t rush into a divorce just yet.

09:04.440 --> 09:06.230
How about you take some time apart

09:07.310 --> 09:08.470
and cool off for a bit?

09:10.090 --> 09:11.390
Or how about this?

09:11.390 --> 09:12.070
Why don't we

09:12.740 --> 09:13.660
wait until...

09:13.720 --> 09:15.530
wait until Haikuo finishes his exams before deciding?

09:38.340 --> 09:38.990
Okay.

09:40.750 --> 09:43.350
Alright.

09:43.350 --> 09:44.870
Then you should rest early.

09:44.870 --> 09:45.600
Okay.

09:57.760 --> 10:05.290
[Families along the canal]

10:08.130 --> 10:13.690
[Families along the canal]

10:27.080 --> 10:30.180
[Families along the canal]

10:49.350 --> 10:50.330
What time is it now?

10:50.360 --> 10:51.540
Why aren't you in bed yet?

10:52.000 --> 10:52.770
In a minute.

10:53.350 --> 10:54.710
What do you mean by 'in a minute'?

10:58.680 --> 10:59.920
I'm talking to you.

11:04.570 --> 11:05.940
Give it back to me.

11:13.200 --> 11:14.120
What's wrong with you?

11:15.340 --> 11:16.310
Nothing.

11:25.340 --> 11:27.190
If you're upset about something,

11:27.510 --> 11:28.510
don't bottle it up.

11:30.350 --> 11:31.070
Tell me about it.

11:32.910 --> 11:33.660
Will you?

11:34.860 --> 11:36.010
When do you plan on divorcing?

11:40.050 --> 11:41.040
I don't know.

11:43.950 --> 11:45.560
It’s not my decision to make either.

11:48.080 --> 11:49.390
Do you want a divorce then?

12:00.500 --> 12:01.570
Have you made any effort?

12:05.590 --> 12:06.310
What effort?

12:06.750 --> 12:07.990
To try and keep Mom from leaving.

12:10.150 --> 12:11.260
If your mom wants to leave,

12:12.070 --> 12:13.670
there's nothing I can do to stop her.

12:13.670 --> 12:14.230
Do you understand?

12:14.230 --> 12:15.190
Then why don't you want to go to Beijing

12:15.190 --> 12:16.150
when Mom asked you to?

12:16.150 --> 12:17.470
What would I do in Beijing?

12:17.790 --> 12:18.710
Would it make any difference?

12:20.080 --> 12:22.070
Your mom spends the entire year filming.

12:22.070 --> 12:22.950
What difference does it make

12:23.180 --> 12:24.950
if I wait for her here or in Beijing?

12:25.910 --> 12:27.540
Then why are you all getting a divorce?

12:28.150 --> 12:29.150
She can continue acting

12:29.150 --> 12:30.200
while you continue to be a chef.

12:30.200 --> 12:31.870
Why can't we just go on like this?

12:39.490 --> 12:40.110
Exactly.

12:44.310 --> 12:45.220
Why indeed?

12:49.350 --> 12:49.750
Dad.

12:53.590 --> 12:54.870
When you two discussed divorce,

12:54.870 --> 12:56.110
have you ever considered

12:57.630 --> 12:59.120
how I might feel about it?

13:00.750 --> 13:02.910
Siyi grew up without her parents by her side.

13:03.550 --> 13:04.830
You can clearly see for yourself

13:04.830 --> 13:05.950
what their family situation is like

13:06.230 --> 13:08.110
and the kind of life they have been living.

13:12.590 --> 13:13.830
So it means you're just being selfish.

13:13.830 --> 13:15.350
You're absolutely right, Dad.

13:17.630 --> 13:19.190
Mom wants to pursue her dreams,

13:21.070 --> 13:21.900
and I support that.

13:24.710 --> 13:26.160
You want to live your own life,

13:26.740 --> 13:27.430
and I understand that too.

13:29.190 --> 13:30.510
But I'm asking both of you

13:32.190 --> 13:33.470
to think about me as well.

14:10.710 --> 14:12.150
Zhimei, I want to ask you for a favor.

14:13.390 --> 14:15.030
No matter what happens between us in the future,

14:17.030 --> 14:18.490
or what decisions we make,

14:20.150 --> 14:21.230
let's not hurt our child.

14:25.390 --> 14:26.780
Let's not give him the impression

14:27.080 --> 14:29.130
that marriage is a terrible thing.

14:33.070 --> 14:33.670
Okay.

15:03.820 --> 15:04.650
Son.

15:05.420 --> 15:06.180
Son?

15:06.690 --> 15:07.550
Mom's leaving.

15:07.550 --> 15:07.990
Zhimei.

15:09.430 --> 15:11.230
Let Haikuo sleep a bit more.

15:11.260 --> 15:13.520
I guess he probably stayed up late studying last night.

15:15.540 --> 15:16.240
Alright.

15:30.080 --> 15:31.780
I want to eat this sesame ball.

15:31.910 --> 15:33.230
Granny, I want to eat this fried radish cake.

15:33.230 --> 15:34.150
Here, here.

15:34.150 --> 15:34.630
Take it.

15:34.630 --> 15:35.580
Thank you, Granny.

15:37.750 --> 15:38.690
Good morning, Granny.

15:39.150 --> 15:39.710
Morning!

15:39.710 --> 15:40.470
Morning, Auntie.

15:40.470 --> 15:41.670
You're here.

15:41.670 --> 15:42.430
Auntie.

15:42.430 --> 15:43.790
Come get your soy milk.

15:43.790 --> 15:44.270
Okay.

15:49.250 --> 15:50.210
Your mom left?

15:53.550 --> 15:54.760
You didn’t go and see her off?

15:55.460 --> 15:56.710
It's not like we're saying goodbye forever.

15:56.710 --> 15:57.840
What's the point of seeing her off?

16:00.110 --> 16:00.630
Are you okay?

16:00.630 --> 16:02.390
Your mom doesn't want you either?

16:03.350 --> 16:05.030
Just eat.

16:05.160 --> 16:07.310
[Breakfast]

16:05.230 --> 16:07.230
You’re young, but you’ve got a lot to say.

16:08.970 --> 16:11.510
[Breakfast]

16:19.760 --> 16:20.560
Don't be upset.

16:22.070 --> 16:23.630
We can meet her when we go to Beijing in the future.

16:24.310 --> 16:26.890
We'll watch a game at the Bird's Nest then.

16:27.000 --> 16:28.000
We'll make your mom pay for it.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.710
I want to go to Beijing too.

16:31.630 --> 16:32.230
Sure.

16:32.630 --> 16:33.830
Let's make a deal.

16:33.830 --> 16:35.990
If you can get into the top ten of your class,

16:36.600 --> 16:37.700
we'll take you with us.

16:38.000 --> 16:40.470
We'll take you to visit the Forbidden City, climb the Great Wall,

16:40.470 --> 16:41.790
and watch the flag-raising ceremony at Tiananmen Square.

16:41.790 --> 16:42.070
How about that?

16:42.070 --> 16:43.990
You said it! It's a promise.

16:44.230 --> 16:44.950
Yes, it's on me.

16:45.100 --> 16:52.640
[Breakfast]

16:45.420 --> 16:46.940
Siyi, can you be my witness?

16:46.990 --> 16:48.230
Fine, I'll be your witness.

16:48.230 --> 16:49.230
Come eat your breakfast quickly.

16:52.860 --> 16:53.350
Let's go.

16:53.350 --> 16:54.120
We're going to be late.

16:54.230 --> 16:55.870
Granny, we're off to school.

16:55.870 --> 16:56.630
Take it easy.

16:57.110 --> 16:57.510
Be careful.

16:57.510 --> 16:59.020
I want one more sesame ball.

16:59.110 --> 17:00.140
Bye.

17:00.470 --> 17:01.910
This kid.

17:01.910 --> 17:02.830
Be careful.

17:02.830 --> 17:03.830
Granny, we're leaving.

17:03.830 --> 17:04.670
Be careful.

17:04.670 --> 17:05.190
We're off.

17:05.190 --> 17:06.630
Take it slow on the road.

17:07.579 --> 17:08.069
Yan.

17:09.710 --> 17:10.240
What are you doing?

17:10.240 --> 17:11.630
Our child has eaten quite a bit.

17:11.630 --> 17:12.069
No need.

17:12.069 --> 17:14.589
Hasn't Fenghua ate plenty of your food too?

17:14.710 --> 17:15.349
Take it.

17:17.589 --> 17:18.230
However,

17:18.990 --> 17:20.780
it looks like Siwei

17:21.750 --> 17:22.569
is not easy to take care of.

17:23.510 --> 17:24.950
It's alright.

17:25.910 --> 17:28.830
He wasn't doing well when he first arrived a few days ago.

17:28.830 --> 17:31.270
He might have gotten used to it in the past few days.

17:31.270 --> 17:32.110
He's doing much better now.

17:32.780 --> 17:35.590
One night, he said he couldn't sleep alone.

17:35.590 --> 17:36.620
He was scared.

17:36.620 --> 17:38.430
He insisted on sleeping with Siyi.

17:38.430 --> 17:40.150
He fell asleep until 5 a.m.,

17:40.630 --> 17:42.350
but when he realised it wasn't his mom when he woke up,

17:42.750 --> 17:43.710
he cried.

17:43.710 --> 17:45.910
It took me quite a while to comfort him.

17:45.910 --> 17:48.810
Isn’t this just giving Siyi another child to look after?

17:49.030 --> 17:49.750
Isn't it?

17:49.750 --> 17:50.630
That's right, Granny.

17:51.230 --> 17:52.740
He's not even your own grandson.

17:53.230 --> 17:54.780
What are you getting out of it?

17:55.310 --> 17:56.630
Granny Ma is just kind-hearted.

17:57.110 --> 17:58.390
Kind people are often taken advantage of,

17:58.390 --> 17:59.670
just like how a gentle horse gets ridden the most.

18:00.310 --> 18:01.550
No.

18:02.630 --> 18:04.670
This is how I see it.

18:05.990 --> 18:08.380
I want to create good karma for myself,

18:08.590 --> 18:09.790
but also...

18:10.950 --> 18:12.190
do Siyi a favor.

18:12.470 --> 18:14.780
In case something happens to me in the future,

18:15.230 --> 18:17.910
Siyi's mother will need to treat Siyi better.

18:25.260 --> 18:25.910
Granny,

18:27.260 --> 18:28.640
let me be frank.

18:29.220 --> 18:30.250
That person...

18:30.870 --> 18:32.390
She only cares about herself.

18:36.630 --> 18:37.870
She cannot be relied on.

18:38.750 --> 18:39.660
Granny Ma,

18:39.810 --> 18:40.690
it's okay.

18:40.710 --> 18:41.880
You have us.

18:42.120 --> 18:43.230
We're all here.

18:44.010 --> 18:45.160
Yes, I have you all.

18:45.230 --> 18:45.750
It's alright.

18:45.750 --> 18:46.310
Yes, I do.

18:46.310 --> 18:47.250
Yes, Granny.

18:47.980 --> 18:48.760
Don't worry.

18:48.780 --> 18:50.210
Yes, I won't worry.

18:50.540 --> 18:52.770
Come, let's tidy up together.

18:53.060 --> 18:54.310
No, just sit there.

18:54.450 --> 18:55.670
I'm already done cleaning up here.

18:55.670 --> 18:57.310
We don't need your help here.

18:57.310 --> 18:58.700
No need at all.

18:59.460 --> 19:00.300
I'll put it here.

19:13.610 --> 19:15.270
What happened? Did you get into a fight?

19:15.290 --> 19:16.970
My brother-in-law tricked me.

19:18.950 --> 19:19.750
He said

19:19.750 --> 19:20.790
if anyone bullies me,

19:20.790 --> 19:22.260
I should lie down on the ground,

19:22.260 --> 19:24.110
roll my eyes, and twitch.

19:24.190 --> 19:25.750
That way, the other person will give in.

19:25.750 --> 19:26.750
Grandma, look at him.

19:26.750 --> 19:27.830
The teacher said no one even touched him,

19:27.830 --> 19:28.790
but he just laid down on the ground

19:28.790 --> 19:29.670
and threatened his classmates

19:29.670 --> 19:31.030
to buy him potato chips,

19:31.030 --> 19:32.110
or else he'd tell the teacher.

19:32.710 --> 19:33.630
That's why he got beaten up.

19:34.670 --> 19:35.920
Who taught you that?

19:35.920 --> 19:37.180
My brother-in-law.

19:37.320 --> 19:38.670
What's wrong with you?

19:38.670 --> 19:40.660
Wait, who's this brother-in-law? Who is it?

19:42.440 --> 19:43.780
He's talking about Wanghe.

19:43.990 --> 19:44.690
Wanghe?

19:45.330 --> 19:46.950
Why are you calling him brother-in-law?

19:47.070 --> 19:47.920
He's crazy.

19:47.920 --> 19:49.070
I’ve told you not to spew nonsense.

19:49.070 --> 19:50.150
We're just good neighbors.

19:50.510 --> 19:51.880
Wanghe likes you.

19:51.880 --> 19:53.360
He wants to be with you.

19:53.510 --> 19:54.280
Ge Siwei!

19:54.550 --> 19:55.110
Stop talking nonsense!

19:55.150 --> 19:55.510
Alright, alright.

19:55.550 --> 19:56.910
I'm not talking nonsense!

19:57.160 --> 19:59.550
He keeps sneaking glances at you on the way to school every day.

19:59.590 --> 20:00.150
You won't stop, huh?

20:00.150 --> 20:01.840
He even looks at you during breakfast.

20:05.790 --> 20:06.590
Ge Siwei!

20:09.590 --> 20:09.990
You!

20:10.550 --> 20:11.110
You little...

20:13.780 --> 20:16.110
Siyi, go easy on your little brother.

20:17.110 --> 20:17.630
Ge Siwei!

20:17.630 --> 20:18.520
Grandma, don't listen to his nonsense.

20:18.550 --> 20:19.310
I know.

20:20.110 --> 20:21.630
You like Wanghe.

20:21.630 --> 20:22.070
What are you saying?

20:22.070 --> 20:23.830
I also know that Wanghe likes you too.

20:24.150 --> 20:25.670
I know everything.

20:27.790 --> 20:28.990
Alright, alright.

20:33.620 --> 20:34.800
Alright, Siyi.

20:38.640 --> 20:39.520
Be gentle.

20:40.150 --> 20:41.140
He's asleep?

20:48.950 --> 20:49.860
He drives me crazy.

20:50.350 --> 20:51.630
I don't know who he takes after.

20:51.790 --> 20:52.590
He just blurts things out.

20:54.720 --> 20:56.420
Children speak without malice.

20:57.870 --> 20:58.700
You know,

20:58.910 --> 21:01.240
you should talk nicely to your brother from now on.

21:01.430 --> 21:02.230
Every time you're together,

21:02.230 --> 21:04.010
you end up fighting.

21:04.390 --> 21:05.930
You'll become enemies if this continues.

21:06.550 --> 21:08.140
Isn't it infuriating?

21:08.350 --> 21:09.270
He's only a few years old,

21:09.750 --> 21:10.790
but he is already so gossipy.

21:12.310 --> 21:13.590
It might not be gossip, right?

21:17.870 --> 21:18.760
I mean...

21:18.990 --> 21:19.910
Aren't you aware of

21:19.930 --> 21:21.950
how Wanghe thinks about you?

21:22.390 --> 21:23.530
Grandma...

21:25.110 --> 21:25.750
Both of you

21:25.750 --> 21:27.470
are good kids.

21:27.910 --> 21:29.630
If you two really have feelings for each other,

21:30.150 --> 21:31.750
I won't object either.

21:32.590 --> 21:34.060
I don't have any feelings for him.

21:34.590 --> 21:35.200
Don't talk nonsense.

21:35.640 --> 21:36.550
Why not?

21:40.830 --> 21:41.750
Wanghe...

21:42.550 --> 21:43.710
likes Fenghua.

21:44.470 --> 21:45.270
He likes...

21:46.150 --> 21:47.430
He likes Fenghua?

21:47.910 --> 21:49.390
How come I didn't notice that?

21:52.390 --> 21:54.070
I heard them confess to each other.

21:55.880 --> 21:58.150
Fenghua said she likes him.

22:00.230 --> 22:02.350
Fenghua said she likes Wang He?

22:02.670 --> 22:04.780
But Wanghe might not like Fenghua.

22:05.430 --> 22:06.950
I think Wanghe likes you instead.

22:17.910 --> 22:20.990
Anyway, I'm focusing all my attention on the college entrance exam now.

22:21.390 --> 22:22.820
I won't let anyone

22:23.110 --> 22:24.390
or anything distract me.

22:26.950 --> 22:28.670
Grandma, give me two more years.

22:29.150 --> 22:30.470
After I graduate from the teachers' college

22:30.470 --> 22:31.590
and come back to be a teacher,

22:31.590 --> 22:32.830
I'll be able to keep you company every day.

22:34.910 --> 22:35.510
Alright,

22:36.070 --> 22:37.070
I'll be waiting.

22:37.670 --> 22:38.310
Come on.

22:46.150 --> 22:47.070
You're back.

22:49.550 --> 22:50.630
How was your day?

22:52.150 --> 22:52.950
It was okay.

22:54.430 --> 22:55.590
Did you make or lose money?

22:57.030 --> 22:57.950
Made some.

22:59.020 --> 23:00.070
How much did you make?

23:03.350 --> 23:04.390
After a whole day's work,

23:05.430 --> 23:06.500
I made 30 yuan.

23:08.310 --> 23:09.550
That's not even counting the cost of meals.

23:12.070 --> 23:13.530
What happened?

23:15.300 --> 23:17.040
Did Boss Xie cause trouble again?

23:18.550 --> 23:19.310
No.

23:19.870 --> 23:20.790
Come on, tell me.

23:25.400 --> 23:27.350
To be honest, we can't blame him.

23:27.350 --> 23:28.830
When we were seafaring previously,

23:28.830 --> 23:31.430
Mr. Du did help us a lot.

23:32.930 --> 23:34.940
Boss Xie couldn't bring himself to refuse,

23:35.610 --> 23:38.080
so he gave a pretty steep discount.

23:38.440 --> 23:39.910
It's always like this.

23:39.910 --> 23:40.870
All about his pride.

23:40.910 --> 23:41.750
If he cares so much about his pride,

23:41.810 --> 23:43.140
he should use his own money to cover it!

23:43.140 --> 23:44.570
Why should our family be dragged into this?

23:44.630 --> 23:45.430
Keep your voice down.

23:45.430 --> 23:46.670
Why are you fussing over it?

23:46.710 --> 23:48.790
Why should I keep my voice down?

23:48.810 --> 23:50.150
How are we supposed to get by like this?

23:50.150 --> 23:51.070
You tell me yourself.

23:51.150 --> 23:52.270
Other people run supermarkets

23:52.300 --> 23:53.340
and they all make money,

23:53.370 --> 23:54.850
but you two keep losing money.

23:54.910 --> 23:55.990
How can we go on living like this?

24:00.120 --> 24:02.390
You need to do something.

24:03.100 --> 24:04.910
You need to do something.

24:05.230 --> 24:06.320
Element.

24:06.350 --> 24:07.350
Element.

24:08.390 --> 24:10.150
What's wrong with you?

24:10.150 --> 24:11.550
My parents are arguing at home.

24:11.740 --> 24:13.580
When do they not argue?

24:13.600 --> 24:15.350
This time it's because of your dad.

24:18.010 --> 24:18.730
Because of what?

24:19.350 --> 24:20.670
I overheard that...

24:21.990 --> 24:24.030
your dad is being too prideful

24:24.110 --> 24:25.150
and keeps offering discounts.

24:25.670 --> 24:27.590
A few days ago, he wouldn't listen to advice

24:27.630 --> 24:28.510
and stocked up too much.

24:29.110 --> 24:30.150
And now, it can't sell.

24:31.490 --> 24:33.300
Regardless, they lost quite a bit of money.

24:33.870 --> 24:35.590
My mom is almost going crazy at home.

24:39.540 --> 24:40.430
I mean...

24:41.190 --> 24:43.790
should I not have let them start the floating supermarket?

24:44.190 --> 24:45.510
I had good intentions.

24:45.550 --> 24:47.070
But in the end, we didn't make any money

24:47.110 --> 24:48.350
and can't even be friends anymore.

24:49.150 --> 24:50.430
I really don't know what it was all for.

24:50.870 --> 24:51.630
Alright.

24:51.950 --> 24:52.990
It's not your fault.

24:53.190 --> 24:54.670
Don't worry, I'll figure something out.

24:55.650 --> 24:56.610
Let's go home.

25:01.050 --> 25:01.870
Dad.

25:02.700 --> 25:03.510
You're back.

25:04.260 --> 25:05.330
You didn't sail today?

25:06.990 --> 25:07.750
I did.

25:07.950 --> 25:08.950
I've been busy all day.

25:21.710 --> 25:22.890
Is the floating supermarket

25:23.480 --> 25:24.210
doing well?

25:27.300 --> 25:28.260
It's alright.

25:29.290 --> 25:30.090
Did you make money?

25:30.430 --> 25:31.240
Of course.

25:32.490 --> 25:33.470
If it's not for the money,

25:33.470 --> 25:35.270
w-what am I even doing all this for?

25:37.200 --> 25:39.710
Why do I feel like you're a bit unhappy?

25:41.890 --> 25:43.080
It's not that dramatic.

25:43.300 --> 25:44.030
Everything's fine.

25:45.260 --> 25:46.550
Then why are you drinking alone?

25:54.750 --> 25:55.830
It's really tiring.

25:57.350 --> 26:00.050
Selling things is quite different from seafaring.

26:01.590 --> 26:02.710
You have to call out to customers

26:03.700 --> 26:06.100
and talk to all kinds of people.

26:06.830 --> 26:08.710
And those people are all your acquaintances.

26:08.990 --> 26:09.790
It's frustrating.

26:12.780 --> 26:14.540
You feel embarrassed, don't you?

26:20.270 --> 26:21.110
Not exactly.

26:23.370 --> 26:24.690
I just feel a bit indignant.

26:24.970 --> 26:27.160
You see, everyone's starting point is about the same,

26:27.180 --> 26:27.870
right?

26:27.910 --> 26:28.390
But look at others.

26:28.390 --> 26:30.910
They're still working on ships, aren't they?

26:30.910 --> 26:32.270
They're all operating big ships.

26:32.790 --> 26:34.390
Now, I've switched to a small ship

26:34.420 --> 26:35.660
and I even have to serve them.

26:38.320 --> 26:40.300
I've become a regular crew from being an elite.

26:54.560 --> 26:55.360
Have some more.

26:57.060 --> 26:58.320
Drink up.

27:01.690 --> 27:02.770
If you have something to say,

27:03.730 --> 27:04.560
just say it.

27:08.520 --> 27:10.800
Every industry has its rules.

27:11.660 --> 27:13.710
I'll print out some

27:13.740 --> 27:15.310
information about the retail industry.

27:15.330 --> 27:16.210
You can study it.

27:16.640 --> 27:17.650
Study what?

27:17.900 --> 27:19.990
How to make more money, of course.

27:20.390 --> 27:22.260
Don't look down on supermarkets.

27:22.490 --> 27:25.170
If you do well, you can also make it into Fortune 500.

27:26.550 --> 27:27.880
Are you looking down on your dad?

27:27.900 --> 27:29.780
You think I can't even run a supermarket?

27:30.630 --> 27:31.500
No, that's not it.

27:32.960 --> 27:34.140
I just think

27:34.360 --> 27:36.440
since it's now a joint operation between two families,

27:36.470 --> 27:38.310
we should discuss and plan together.

27:40.230 --> 27:41.650
Discuss with whom?

27:42.750 --> 27:43.840
Xia Lao'er?

27:45.180 --> 27:45.830
He, he...

27:45.870 --> 27:46.710
He's so cowardly.

27:46.710 --> 27:47.910
What ideas could he possibly have?

27:47.910 --> 27:48.990
What's there to discuss?

27:49.010 --> 27:49.770
I'll do it my way

27:49.800 --> 27:51.760
and he just needs to follow along diligently, that's all.

27:51.910 --> 27:52.560
Dad,

27:53.630 --> 27:56.140
he was your assistant when you were seafaring.

27:56.510 --> 27:58.600
Now, you're business partners.

27:58.620 --> 28:00.290
You need to adjust your mindset.

28:00.320 --> 28:01.610
You can't act recklessly.

28:02.270 --> 28:03.230
You little rascal.

28:03.260 --> 28:04.580
Have you ever run a supermarket?

28:06.560 --> 28:07.070
No,

28:07.180 --> 28:09.080
why do you want to meddle in everything?

28:09.120 --> 28:11.170
You should use that energy for your revision.

28:12.670 --> 28:14.360
My grades have improved a lot recently.

28:14.550 --> 28:16.400
What about you? Have you made any money?

28:18.870 --> 28:19.870
Aren’t you done yet?

28:21.150 --> 28:23.160
No, why are you getting so worked up?

28:23.430 --> 28:24.270
Feeling guilty?

28:25.780 --> 28:27.440
Y-You say that again.

28:27.560 --> 28:28.670
Alright, alright.

28:28.710 --> 28:29.780
I'll stop.

28:30.860 --> 28:32.200
Just keep on losing money.

28:32.260 --> 28:33.740
Let’s see how long you can keep up with the payments.

28:34.780 --> 28:35.500
Stop drinking.

28:36.930 --> 28:37.670
Hey!

28:38.840 --> 28:40.680
Are you trying to boss me around now?

29:10.690 --> 29:11.640
Xie.

29:11.660 --> 29:13.320
What's going on with you?

29:13.520 --> 29:15.290
You were the one begging us for wholesale,

29:15.310 --> 29:17.450
and now, you're bringing it back for a refund.

29:17.470 --> 29:19.180
It's been over ten days since you bought these goods.

29:19.220 --> 29:21.170
We really shouldn't be refunding you for all of these.

29:21.200 --> 29:21.960
No.

29:22.310 --> 29:25.460
As you know, I’ve only just started in this line of work.

29:25.490 --> 29:27.860
I don't know what sells well and what doesn't.

29:27.880 --> 29:29.350
I, I, I...

29:29.660 --> 29:31.280
Could you please...

29:31.310 --> 29:31.870
give me a refund?

29:31.900 --> 29:33.140
All my money is tied up in this.

29:33.250 --> 29:35.330
You've been working on the river for so many years.

29:35.350 --> 29:37.750
Don't you know what seafarers need?

29:37.810 --> 29:38.470
Well...

29:38.700 --> 29:40.860
I thought I knew.

29:40.890 --> 29:42.270
You see, when I was working on boats,

29:42.290 --> 29:43.370
we were all drinking

29:43.410 --> 29:45.130
bottled water like these.

29:45.150 --> 29:46.020
And this bread,

29:46.050 --> 29:47.740
these were all essentials on board.

29:47.780 --> 29:49.510
I stocked up on three boxes, and guess what?

29:49.840 --> 29:52.080
I've only sold five or six packets of this bread.

29:53.150 --> 29:53.740
I...

29:53.890 --> 29:55.140
So I'm asking you...

29:55.170 --> 29:56.400
Back in your day,

29:56.430 --> 29:58.970
making money on the canal was so easy.

29:59.260 --> 30:01.060
Seafaring is such a tough job now.

30:01.310 --> 30:03.990
Who’d be willing to buy bottled water like this on the ship?

30:04.030 --> 30:05.230
Or bread for that matter?

30:07.080 --> 30:08.390
Forget it, Xie.

30:08.610 --> 30:10.200
For old times' sake,

30:10.230 --> 30:11.320
I'll give you a refund.

30:12.080 --> 30:12.520
Okay, great.

30:12.550 --> 30:13.720
Thank you, thank you.

30:16.020 --> 30:16.730
Xie!

30:17.980 --> 30:19.920
We can't take back this bread.

30:19.950 --> 30:21.290
Why can't you take it back?

30:21.550 --> 30:24.150
This bread has an expiration date.

30:24.200 --> 30:25.410
It's only good for about ten days or so.

30:25.610 --> 30:27.030
It might have already expired.

30:27.050 --> 30:27.850
That's impossible.

30:27.890 --> 30:29.640
These are still sealed.

30:29.670 --> 30:30.110
Look!

30:30.140 --> 30:31.470
This one expires tomorrow.

30:32.180 --> 30:32.860
No way.

30:32.890 --> 30:34.190
We really can't take this back.

30:34.300 --> 30:35.060
No, no.

30:36.060 --> 30:37.580
Y-You listen to me first.

30:37.590 --> 30:40.040
I mean, if these items were to be

30:40.080 --> 30:41.800
displayed in your store,

30:41.870 --> 30:43.580
it will probably sell out in a day.

30:43.580 --> 30:45.290
But with me, they'll just go to waste.

30:45.380 --> 30:46.390
That won't do.

30:46.420 --> 30:48.670
Nowadays, customers always check the expiration date.

30:48.690 --> 30:49.570
No, I won't take it back.

30:49.600 --> 30:50.260
How about this?

30:50.290 --> 30:51.450
I'll give you a refund

30:51.470 --> 30:52.670
for all of the drinks.

31:03.600 --> 31:04.480
Give it to me!

31:04.960 --> 31:06.050
Stop drinking!

31:06.900 --> 31:07.830
You're drinking every day!

31:07.860 --> 31:08.950
It's fine to drink occasionally.

31:08.980 --> 31:09.940
Do you still want your liver?

31:09.960 --> 31:11.570
You misbehave as soon as Mom leaves.

31:11.700 --> 31:13.470
How will she go out without worrying about you in the future?

31:14.750 --> 31:15.410
Give it to me!

31:16.170 --> 31:17.140
Give it to me!

31:17.400 --> 31:18.340
I'll beat you to death!

31:18.380 --> 31:19.280
I... I...

31:59.100 --> 32:06.590
[Striving unceasingly with unwavering resolve]

31:59.860 --> 32:00.490
Okay.

32:00.860 --> 32:01.550
Class dismissed.

32:01.860 --> 32:02.700
Stand up!

32:03.230 --> 32:06.710
Goodbye, Sir.

32:06.900 --> 32:07.760
Want some grilled sausages?

32:07.800 --> 32:08.360
My treat.

32:08.510 --> 32:08.950
No, thanks.

32:08.990 --> 32:09.600
I'll have some.

32:09.880 --> 32:10.510
Hurry up, you two.

32:10.560 --> 32:11.640
I'll wait for you up ahead.

32:16.500 --> 32:17.110
Boss!

32:17.110 --> 32:17.860
Two grilled sausages, please.

32:18.050 --> 32:18.910
Alright!

32:20.040 --> 32:21.620
These chicken strips look pretty good.

32:22.160 --> 32:22.880
You want some?

32:22.930 --> 32:24.180
If you're treating, I'll have some.

32:24.230 --> 32:25.420
Fine, I'll treat you.

32:25.470 --> 32:26.190
One more chicken strips too.

32:26.220 --> 32:27.220
Coming right up!

32:34.550 --> 32:35.760
So you're Xie Wanghe.

32:36.140 --> 32:36.940
What's the matter?

32:38.430 --> 32:39.170
Beat him up!

32:39.400 --> 32:39.950
Whack!

32:53.680 --> 32:54.720
What's going on?

32:55.820 --> 32:56.770
What are you doing?

32:57.460 --> 32:58.900
Run! Run!

33:01.780 --> 33:03.050
Wanghe, are you alright?

33:05.520 --> 33:06.460
What happened?

33:06.480 --> 33:07.080
What's this all about?

33:07.080 --> 33:07.700
Who did you offend?

33:07.730 --> 33:08.770
How would I know?

33:09.910 --> 33:10.670
Is your hand injured?

33:21.680 --> 33:22.820
-Sir.
-Sir.

33:23.590 --> 33:24.590
it's been taken care of.

33:26.910 --> 33:28.980
I don't want that 10,000 yuan anymore.

33:29.830 --> 33:32.040
Consider it as medical expenses for that kid.

33:32.130 --> 33:33.270
Hai is so generous!

33:33.300 --> 33:33.960
Generous.

33:37.150 --> 33:38.080
Thank you, Hai.

33:38.380 --> 33:40.220
Hai, if something like this happens again,

33:40.240 --> 33:41.070
just give us a call.

33:41.110 --> 33:42.580
We'll take care of it for you directly.

33:42.700 --> 33:43.540
No rush.

33:44.870 --> 33:47.710
Let me think about how to deal with that girl.

33:49.120 --> 33:50.350
I personally

33:50.530 --> 33:51.660
don't lack money,

33:54.700 --> 33:55.660
but I'm lacking my pride.

34:03.670 --> 34:08.159
[Floating Supermarket]

34:03.800 --> 34:05.790
Flower Street Floating Supermarket!

34:05.820 --> 34:07.750
We have cigarettes, alcohol, snacks, daily necessities,

34:07.770 --> 34:09.260
rice, oil, and vegetables,

34:09.290 --> 34:11.070
One-stop shopping,

34:11.070 --> 34:12.070
fast and affordable.

34:12.070 --> 34:13.739
We warmly welcome you!

34:13.949 --> 34:15.179
Mon, don't be like this!

34:15.179 --> 34:16.989
I don't want to live anymore!

34:17.110 --> 34:18.550
Mom, no!

34:18.790 --> 34:20.080
Don't jump, Mom!

34:23.840 --> 34:24.940
What should we do, Boss?

34:25.670 --> 34:26.980
Help!

34:27.000 --> 34:28.469
Save my mom, please!

34:29.750 --> 34:30.880
Dock now! Dock now!

34:30.909 --> 34:32.560
Be careful, Boss!

34:32.870 --> 34:34.340
Save her!

34:34.889 --> 34:35.960
Help!

34:36.820 --> 34:37.380
Mom!

34:38.030 --> 34:38.670
Mom!

34:38.699 --> 34:40.620
Mom, hang on!

34:46.949 --> 34:48.219
I'll get you out of there.

34:48.250 --> 34:49.260
Don't move, stay still!

34:56.350 --> 34:56.870
Mom!

34:57.580 --> 34:58.460
Mom!

35:20.440 --> 35:21.190
How is she?

35:21.190 --> 35:21.670
Is she okay?

35:21.670 --> 35:22.910
Is... Is she alright?

35:23.070 --> 35:23.540
Mom!

35:23.700 --> 35:24.150
Mom!

35:24.190 --> 35:24.910
Is she okay?

35:25.110 --> 35:26.080
Is she alright?

35:26.170 --> 35:26.630
Come on, come on.

35:26.630 --> 35:27.690
Sit up.

35:27.720 --> 35:28.270
Are you okay?

35:28.270 --> 35:29.140
You scared me!

35:29.230 --> 35:30.730
You really scared me!

35:30.990 --> 35:32.350
Are you alright, Boss?

35:32.350 --> 35:33.590
Why would you do something like that?

35:33.830 --> 35:34.550
Put this on.

35:34.580 --> 35:36.120
How do you feel?

35:36.270 --> 35:36.870
Are you feeling better?

35:36.890 --> 35:37.700
That was too...

35:37.870 --> 35:39.040
too dangerous.

35:39.740 --> 35:41.000
Thank goodness it was you.

35:42.650 --> 35:43.550
Here's your medicine.

35:43.590 --> 35:44.230
Thank you.

35:46.920 --> 35:47.600
How are you?

35:50.630 --> 35:51.520
Fractured ribs

35:51.540 --> 35:52.530
and a fractured left arm.

35:52.730 --> 35:54.010
Good thing it's your left hand that's injured.

35:54.040 --> 35:55.400
Otherwise, you wouldn't be able to even do your homework.

35:56.260 --> 35:58.340
Do these fractures count as internal injuries?

35:58.370 --> 35:59.010
No, it doesn't.

36:01.750 --> 36:02.840
Think about it carefully.

36:03.000 --> 36:04.070
Who did you offend?

36:04.930 --> 36:06.360
Who could I have offended?

36:06.950 --> 36:09.170
Could it be that guy who promised Fenghua commercials?

36:09.740 --> 36:11.570
He asked us for money before, and we didn't give it to him.

36:11.590 --> 36:12.600
We even threatened him.

36:13.870 --> 36:15.650
Regardless of whether it was those guys or not,

36:15.680 --> 36:17.550
we can't let Fenghua know about this.

36:17.720 --> 36:18.490
Why?

36:19.380 --> 36:20.880
With that pig brain of hers,

36:20.910 --> 36:22.240
she won't be able to help with anything.

36:22.470 --> 36:23.710
if she finds out, she'll just cry.

36:23.980 --> 36:24.990
It's annoying.

36:26.390 --> 36:27.560
If it really was them,

36:27.590 --> 36:28.580
we should just report it to the police.

36:28.600 --> 36:29.470
Your injuries are considered severe.

36:29.510 --> 36:30.390
He'll be sentenced once caught.

36:30.680 --> 36:31.320
Evidence?

36:32.270 --> 36:34.140
There are cameras at the school entrance.

36:34.310 --> 36:35.630
There are cameras at the school entrance,

36:35.650 --> 36:36.760
but not there.

36:37.290 --> 36:38.950
If they had already decided to beat me up,

36:38.980 --> 36:40.510
would they leave any evidence?

36:46.060 --> 36:48.040
There are many ways to get revenge.

36:48.060 --> 36:49.440
But I'm not sure

36:50.260 --> 36:52.430
what they might do if they get desperate.

36:52.450 --> 36:53.840
The key is that Fenghua is around.

36:54.200 --> 36:55.990
If they target her, it could be troublesome.

36:56.870 --> 36:57.860
But what should we do then?

36:57.940 --> 36:59.170
Just take a beating for nothing?

36:59.470 --> 37:00.620
Don't worry about that.

37:01.740 --> 37:03.550
I, Xie Wanghe, can tolerate anything,

37:03.570 --> 37:04.890
but I won't be taken advantage of.

37:05.340 --> 37:07.660
Let's align on how we will explain what happened today.

37:07.970 --> 37:09.050
With our families,

37:09.070 --> 37:10.570
just say that I fell while playing basketball.

37:10.600 --> 37:12.500
Whatever you do, don't say I got beaten up.

37:13.470 --> 37:15.030
With my dad's temper,

37:15.260 --> 37:16.350
if he finds out what really happened,

37:16.500 --> 37:18.520
he might go after those guys with a knife.

37:35.380 --> 37:36.490
Who hit you?

37:37.190 --> 37:38.320
Nobody hit me.

37:38.350 --> 37:39.350
I fell while playing basketball.

37:39.380 --> 37:40.570
Nonsense!

37:42.870 --> 37:44.740
You disappeared right after school today.

37:45.410 --> 37:47.290
I checked the basketball courts, and no one was there.

37:47.900 --> 37:49.560
Tell me, who did it?

37:50.070 --> 37:51.910
Can you be more reasonable?

37:52.460 --> 37:53.870
I really just fell while playing basketball.

37:55.100 --> 37:56.060
Was it Hai?

37:56.110 --> 37:56.870
No.

38:00.880 --> 38:02.260
So it's him.

38:03.270 --> 38:05.270
He asked me for money before and I didn't give him any.

38:05.310 --> 38:07.120
So he went after you.

38:07.210 --> 38:08.590
It really wasn't.

38:08.760 --> 38:09.960
Can you stop crying, please?

38:09.990 --> 38:10.900
Can you shut up for a while?

38:10.950 --> 38:12.360
You're giving me a headache.

38:13.110 --> 38:14.350
You got hit on the head?

38:14.540 --> 38:15.710
Let me see if it hurts.

38:15.790 --> 38:17.910
Can you stop being so mushy?

38:20.150 --> 38:21.690
How am I being mushy?

38:25.550 --> 38:26.670
Alright, everything's fine.

38:26.690 --> 38:27.250
Take this.

38:27.290 --> 38:28.120
I'll hold him.

38:30.850 --> 38:31.830
Don't press on my hand.

38:31.910 --> 38:32.790
Don't press on my hand.

38:39.410 --> 38:40.790
D-Don't touch me.

38:42.340 --> 38:43.210
My dad!

38:43.460 --> 38:44.340
Xie Wanghe!

38:47.350 --> 38:47.870
Uncle.

38:47.870 --> 38:49.200
What brings you here?

38:58.680 --> 39:00.890
You got yourself into this state just from a fight?

39:01.350 --> 39:03.860
What fight? It wasn't a fight.

39:04.160 --> 39:05.260
I fell while playing basketball.

39:05.870 --> 39:06.540
How did you fall?

39:07.880 --> 39:08.680
Well...

39:08.710 --> 39:11.710
I was pushed from behind while going for a rebound

39:11.710 --> 39:12.470
and fell to the ground.

39:12.750 --> 39:13.230
Is that so?

39:13.390 --> 39:14.390
Yeah, that's right.

39:14.790 --> 39:15.390
Yes, yes, that's correct.

39:15.410 --> 39:16.640
We can testify that's what happened.

39:16.670 --> 39:17.680
Don't worry, Uncle.

39:17.700 --> 39:19.260
We're good boys who never fight.

39:20.900 --> 39:21.970
You sure know how to take a fall.

39:22.960 --> 39:25.270
Landing on your left arm and right cheek at the same time.

39:26.270 --> 39:27.210
What kind of posture is that?

39:27.470 --> 39:28.710
Someone demonstrate it for me?

39:30.960 --> 39:31.940
Left arm...

39:32.870 --> 39:35.460
So, he was going for a layup, then got pushed, and...

39:39.420 --> 39:40.610
So, were you alone this time?

39:43.500 --> 39:44.560
Who beat you up?

39:44.750 --> 39:46.760
How many of them were there, and what do they do?

39:46.950 --> 39:48.710
I told you, it wasn't a fight.

39:48.990 --> 39:50.150
I know what I'm doing.

39:50.170 --> 39:50.890
You don't have to worry about it.

39:50.930 --> 39:51.760
You know what you're doing?

39:52.070 --> 39:53.520
But getting beaten up like this?

39:54.040 --> 39:55.510
You're a hollow log that

39:55.760 --> 39:56.520
is only good for firewood.

39:56.550 --> 39:57.160
Let's go home.

39:58.030 --> 39:59.390
My ribs hurt too.

40:04.680 --> 40:05.720
Then get on.

40:05.760 --> 40:06.590
Come on.

40:06.670 --> 40:07.140
Get on.

40:07.170 --> 40:07.970
Come.

40:08.080 --> 40:09.910
It’s embarrassing with so many people watching.

40:10.020 --> 40:11.170
Cut the crap. Get on.

40:13.540 --> 40:14.100
Hurry up!

40:16.550 --> 40:17.650
Gently, gently.

40:21.230 --> 40:23.290
Bring my bicycle back for me, will you?

40:26.670 --> 40:27.660
Take it easy, Dad.

40:46.270 --> 40:46.800
Alright.

40:46.970 --> 40:47.790
Okay, okay.

40:47.830 --> 40:48.390
You lie down first.

40:52.300 --> 40:52.910
What are you waiting for?

40:52.910 --> 40:53.270
Go, go, go.

40:53.270 --> 40:54.510
Go home.

40:55.280 --> 40:55.920
Just go home!

40:59.140 --> 40:59.920
Fenghua.

41:01.080 --> 41:02.330
G-Go home.

41:02.460 --> 41:03.230
I won't.

41:03.710 --> 41:05.070
I have nothing to do at home anyway.

41:07.680 --> 41:09.080
Who on earth beat you up like this?

41:14.480 --> 41:15.960
How pathetic.

41:19.120 --> 41:19.820
Wanghe,

41:20.270 --> 41:21.610
What do you want to eat?

41:21.790 --> 41:22.680
I'll ask my mom to make it.

41:22.900 --> 41:24.630
Please just go home quickly.

41:24.670 --> 41:25.990
Can you stop hovering around me?

41:26.010 --> 41:26.790
No way.

41:29.550 --> 41:30.230
Well...

41:31.650 --> 41:32.970
A snack for you if you are hungry.

41:32.990 --> 41:33.750
Thank you.

41:34.200 --> 41:35.190
Where are you going?

41:35.890 --> 41:37.360
Why should I report everything I do to you?

41:39.340 --> 41:40.140
He's back?

41:40.170 --> 41:41.000
Yes.

41:41.540 --> 41:42.860
-He just got carried back.
-Where is Wanghe?

41:42.890 --> 41:43.830
He got carried back?

41:45.020 --> 41:46.250
Carried?

41:46.280 --> 41:48.070
Boss, how is Wanghe?

41:48.070 --> 41:49.520
That kid’s tough as nails.

41:49.540 --> 41:50.690
He'll be fine in a few days.

41:50.730 --> 41:51.840
It's not that easy to recover.

41:51.860 --> 41:53.450
It takes a hundred days to heal bones and muscles.

41:53.490 --> 41:55.080
I'll make him some pig’s trotter soup for dinner

41:55.100 --> 41:55.820
to strengthen his bones.

41:55.850 --> 41:56.890
Yes.

41:56.900 --> 41:58.440
You're treating him like your son-in-law.

41:58.470 --> 41:59.860
Of course.

41:59.890 --> 42:00.410
Granny.

42:00.440 --> 42:01.850
Please have this.

42:01.870 --> 42:02.550
Here.

42:02.670 --> 42:03.590
You have a business to run.

42:03.590 --> 42:04.070
Just have some.

42:04.070 --> 42:04.830
I had overstocked

42:04.830 --> 42:05.890
and it's not selling.

42:06.150 --> 42:07.090
Maotian said it won't sell,

42:07.130 --> 42:08.850
but you didn't believe him, did you?

42:08.870 --> 42:10.300
A lesson learned the hard way.

42:10.340 --> 42:12.250
No one’s money comes easily.

42:12.280 --> 42:13.800
That... that's right.

42:13.840 --> 42:14.560
You are right.

42:14.590 --> 42:15.310
Just take it.

42:15.310 --> 42:16.730
Share it around.

42:16.750 --> 42:17.920
Ask me for more when you're done.

42:17.940 --> 42:20.260
Okay, I'll visit Wanghe again.

42:20.290 --> 42:22.050
Tell me if you need anything.

42:22.150 --> 42:23.670
Look, take a look yourself.

42:23.670 --> 42:25.510
I didn't know all of this bread would be so hard to sell.

42:25.510 --> 42:26.470
My heart aches for you

42:26.470 --> 42:28.190
and for our family.

42:28.230 --> 42:29.390
If you continue this way,

42:29.390 --> 42:30.510
how are we going to live?

42:30.510 --> 42:31.750
So much nagging.

42:31.790 --> 42:33.620
I know I did wrong, okay?

42:33.770 --> 42:34.920
You nag all day.

42:35.270 --> 42:36.870
Have you considered how hard I've been working?

42:36.890 --> 42:38.680
We’ve put so much money into this.

42:38.980 --> 42:40.610
All of it is hard-earned.

42:40.640 --> 42:42.360
And now, you're just giving it all away.

42:42.380 --> 42:43.820
Can you be more careful?

42:46.010 --> 42:46.970
Haikuo!

42:47.880 --> 42:48.590
Haikuo!

42:49.510 --> 42:50.220
Come.

42:55.240 --> 42:56.340
Uncle, what's wrong?

42:56.360 --> 42:57.100
Are you looking for me?

42:58.620 --> 42:59.690
Why did you all get into a fight?

43:01.770 --> 43:03.420
We didn't fight.

43:03.470 --> 43:05.000
He fell while playing basketball.

43:06.210 --> 43:07.220
How many of them were there?
